{"synopsis":"Sang protagonis, yang telah bekerja keras di Aliansi Murim, akhirnya pensiun dan kembali ke kampung halamannya untuk mewujudkan mimpinya menjadi pemimpin sekte.\n\nKarena tabungannya yang sedikit, dia akhirnya membeli sebuah rumah bangsawan yang harganya murah, dan dikabarkan berhantu.\n\nTapi kemudian, sistem asing tiba-tiba muncul di hadapannya. Meskipun terkejut pada awalnya, sang protagonis segera mulai menggunakan sistem tersebut untuk merekrut murid secara efisien dan mengelola keuangan dan sumber daya sekte tersebut.\n\nBelakangan, dengan bantuan sistem, sektenya berkembang pesat, sedemikian rupa sehingga mulai menarik perhatian, kewaspadaan, dan permusuhan dari faksi Murim lainnya…","alternative_title":"문파시스템을 시작합니다","author":"CHOI Yoon-Jin","artist":"Black Ink","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"d738c242-268a-41d3-b980-824915a1fb97","number":"48","chapter":"48","title":"Chapter 48","date":"2026-07-30","released":"2026-07-30","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"7256ec41-59e2-48f7-873e-3bdb4f26b65b","number":"47","chapter":"47","title":"Chapter 47","date":"2026-07-30","released":"2026-07-30","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"f447a439-f023-430f-a699-d885dd0c136b","number":"46","chapter":"46","title":"Chapter 46","date":"2026-07-15","released":"2026-07-15","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"b7f46b3f-fef7-4a43-b064-ce242bf4f074","number":"45","chapter":"45","title":"Chapter 45","date":"2026-07-09","released":"2026-07-09","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"626be84c-f02f-46e7-89a4-99b42d9f42f0","number":"44","chapter":"44","title":"Chapter 44","date":"2026-06-30","released":"2026-06-30","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"c7a3aba8-1af9-41a0-a029-2ae43147702b","number":"43","chapter":"43","title":"Chapter 43","date":"2026-06-29","released":"2026-06-29","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"83f4c558-05d2-4693-87bc-75a74b15908d","number":"42","chapter":"42","title":"Chapter 42","date":"2026-06-23","released":"2026-06-23","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"6bcb12a2-3d2d-424a-b121-0d603126bfb2","number":"41","chapte